Usage of ./bench:
  -appep string
    	app endpoint (default "https://localhost.isucon8.flying-chair.net")
  -bankep string
    	isubank endpoint (default "https://compose.isucon8.flying-chair.net:5515")
  -internalbank string
    	isubank endpoint (for internal) (default "https://localhost.isucon8.flying-chair.net:5515")
  -internallog string
    	isulog endpoint (for internal) (default "https://localhost.isucon8.flying-chair.net:5516")
  -jobid string
    	portal jobid
  -log string
    	output log path (default stderr)
  -logep string
    	isulog endpoint (default "https://compose.isucon8.flying-chair.net:5516")
  -result string
    	result json path (default stdout)
  -stateout string
    	save state filename
  -teestdout string
    	tee stdout
